"Use <b>Refresh Terms</b> to load them for chosen models, modules\n"
"               or languages (leave empty for everything). Every translatable\n"
"               term is collected — Python, JavaScript, QWeb, fields, views and\n"
"               menus — whether already translated or not."
msgstr "Brug <b>Opdater termer</b> til at indlæse dem for valgte modeller, moduler\n               eller sprog (lad stå tom for alt). Alle oversættelige\n               termer indsamles — Python, JavaScript, QWeb, felter, visninger og\n               menuer — uanset om de allerede er oversat eller ej."

